message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VERIDEX: Reference Validation and Provenance Auditing against Crossref and OpenAlex"
abstract: "A command-line tool that validates a reference list (plain text, BibTeX, or RIS) or a list of DOIs against Crossref and OpenAlex, keeping a verification ledger for re-run auditing. Designed for use by LLM agents and researchers preparing manuscripts."
